# MailWatch queue display: allow apache (member of mtagroup) to list the
# hold/incoming queues so the "Postfix Mail Queue" page can count messages.
# These entries OVERRIDE the base postfix-files defaults (700 $mail_owner:-)
# because postfix-files.d/* is processed AFTER postfix-files by post-install,
# so "postfix set-permissions" (run on start/reload/package upgrade) keeps
# these perms instead of resetting them to 700 postfix:root.
# Format: name:type:owner:group:permission:flags  (path MUST stay $-prefixed)
$queue_directory/hold:d:$mail_owner:mtagroup:750:uc
$queue_directory/incoming:d:$mail_owner:mtagroup:750:uc
